        desc = "VSD1P0RESO is a VSD1 region 0 resolution register (non-instant register). VSD1P0RESO (offset 0x4400 (m = 0-63), total reset 0x0000_0000; PROVEN: Hi3518E V100 data sheet, PDF page 709, section 5.8). Per-instance register (offset = 0x4400 (m = 0~63)); the first instance is modelled.";
